WEBVTT

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.570
Damn it all...

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.120
Why?

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:18.050
This doesn't make sense!

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:20.080
It's over after one fight?

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:24.000
I won't let it end like this!

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:57.720
<i>Why?</i>

00:01:59.070 --> 00:02:01.020
<i>Why did this happen?</i>

00:02:01.650 --> 00:02:04.650
<i>The old me wasn't like this...</i>

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:08.230
<i>Back in elementary school,</i>

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:11.080
<i>I was one of the popular kids in class.</i>

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:14.190
<i>We would bully any classmates who 
were awkward and had no friends.</i>

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:15.530
Now!

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:21.050
Sorry, Kiyoi-chan!

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:23.410
We didn't see you down there!

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:27.530
<i>So when I ran into Kiyoi-chan 
again in middle school,</i>

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:28.620
<i>I was so surprised.</i>

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:30.940
Hello, Selector-san.

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:33.090
You've been chosen.

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:39.510
<i>Kiyoi-chan didn't seem to realize it,</i>

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:43.000
<i>but she and I made a good team.</i>

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:45.510
<i>I did a great job of manipulating her,</i>

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:47.730
<i>and we won our battles.</i>

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:54.270
<i>It was so fun to watch the way she 
believed me and did what I told her.</i>

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:59.150
<i>And when she became an Eternal Girl, 
she and I switched places,</i>

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:02.360
<i>and I kept my promise with her.</i>

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:06.660
<i>When I was chosen again 
for the Selector battles,</i>

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:09.820
<i>I was sick of Kiyoi-chan's body,</i>

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:13.130
<i>so my goal was to get my old body back.</i>

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:16.130
<i>And then I ran into her again.</i>

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:20.550
<i>That idiot Kiyoi-chan gave up 
her chance to be human again.</i>

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:24.680
<i>I became an Eternal Girl and,
in the final step toward my goal,</i>

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:29.140
<i>I became the LRIG of the girl 
who owned my original body.</i>

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:30.800
Well?

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:34.520
If you do this, you'll be able to 
get your old body back for sure!

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:38.050
This time, I'm the LRIG, 
and you're the Selector.

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:40.280
It must be fate!

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:43.660
"If I just act polite and do 
what the fortune-telling says,

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.160
a happy future will come." Was that it?

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:48.870
That's right! I'm so glad you remember!

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:51.720
Are you stupid?

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:54.830
I never liked that about you.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:59.940
You know, I really like your body.

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:05.220
Hey, wait...

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:08.970
Wait... Stop! No! This is a joke, right?!

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:12.770
I'm taking your life all for myself.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:15.830
But... You can't... No! No!

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:22.810
<i>I was trapped for what felt like an eternity.</i>

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:44.760
<i>And then, that suddenly ended.</i>

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:51.470
<i>But something had gone wrong...</i>

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:55.140
I'll get tired easily today,

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:57.940
and my lucky color is green, huh?

00:04:58.200 --> 00:04:59.180
What's she doing?

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:00.420
You didn't know?

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:03.490
She uses fortune-telling to 
decide everything in her life.

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:07.450
I heard the reason she skipped school the 
other day was because of a bad fortune.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:09.200
What? That's scary!

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.470
That's getting way too into it.

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:12.430
They say she's a little crazy.

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:14.380
You should stay away from her.

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:18.110
<i>This isn't right... Why?</i>

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:21.510
<i>I wasn't like this.</i>

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:23.880
<i>I... I...</i>

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:27.930
6/24
Cleaning today was so much fun! 
Me, Mio-chan, Azusa-chan, and the others
all said that Kiyoi-chan was gross,
so we decided to clean her up by throwing
a bucket of water on her.
Her shocked face was just PERFECT.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:33.890
6/24
Cleaning today was so much fun! 
Me, Mio-chan, Azusa-chan, and the others
all said that Kiyoi-chan was gross,
so we decided to clean her up by throwing
a bucket of water on her.
Her shocked face was just PERFECT.

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:37.400
That's it.

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:39.560
It's because I don't have Kiyoi-chan!

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.590
When she was around, 
everything went perfectly.

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:44.840
So that's it.

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:48.200
I need Kiyoi-chan in my life.

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:50.520
I want to see Kiyoi-chan again...

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.330
I want to see her!

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:53.240
I want to see her!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:53.990
I want to see her!

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:55.240
I want to see her!

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:56.200
I want to see her!

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:57.700
I want to see her! I want to see her!

00:05:57.810 --> 00:05:59.220
I want to see her! I want to see her!

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:01.130
I want to see her! I want to see her!

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:02.540
Do you want to see her?

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:08.090
Is this... the room of white windows?

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.190
Why?

00:06:11.190 --> 00:06:12.600
Do you want to play?

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:13.810
With her.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:14.940
Again.

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:16.260
With her.

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:17.430
Do you want to be friends?

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:19.700
To see her suffer?

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:21.200
To be with her?

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:22.600
To fight her?

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:23.400
To see her?

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:30.700
I guess I shouldn't have come here on a whim.

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:33.320
I didn't expect to be ambushed.

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:36.700
Book me a battle with Mizushima Kiyoi.

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:38.220
Sorry.

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:41.840
I'm not Satomi Kou or 
the bookmaker anymore.

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:42.960
What do you mean?

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:45.210
You should be able to guess.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:48.920
I'm Carnival, his LRIG.

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:51.680
And anyway, Mizushima Kiyoi beat you,

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:53.950
so you don't have any LRIGs anymore, right?

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:55.310
You're out of the battle.

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:59.270
All you can do now is wait 
for your coins to disappear.

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:02.370
I want to beat the shit out of her.

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:06.400
I want to warp that stupid 
smirk of hers with despair.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.780
Well, I can't help.

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:11.760
Wait!

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:13.830
Give me an LRIG, then!

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:15.890
I'll give it back when I crush Kiyoi!

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:18.160
I don't care if I lose 
my memories after that.

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:22.540
I don't care if I lose all my 
memories of this stupid life!

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:26.040
I'm impressed by your obsession with her,

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:28.390
but you can't just lend someone a LRIG.

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:30.990
I've never heard of that...

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:42.230
An LRIG?

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:46.090
I'm Remember.

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:48.570
I'm dying to see Mizushima Kiyoi-chan again!

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:50.040
You know her?

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:51.450
I sure do!

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:55.780
And I'm absolutely dying to see her!

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:00.500
I can make that happen.

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:03.460
Let's play with Kiyoi-chan together!

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:09.380
A new pawn that I don't know...

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:10.760
Interesting.

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:19.700
Naturally, we're not here to do karaoke.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:21.140
I know that!

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:23.320
Main topic.

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:24.880
Let us begin.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:27.940
I invited Morikawa-san, too, I thought.

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:31.940
I guess Chi-chan had other plans...

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:34.150
She said she'd give it a pass.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:35.570
I see.

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:40.320
Putting together the information 
we've all gathered,

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:42.690
it feels like someone is controlling

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:46.250
this round of Selector battles 
for their own purposes.

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:47.990
Controlling?

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:49.170
Doubt.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:53.970
I think it could be said that Satomi 
was controlling the previous battles.

00:08:54.420 --> 00:09:00.930
Satomi simply prepared the stage 
and watched Selectors suffer on it.

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:05.270
But this time, it feels like 
they're trying to interfere

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:08.150
with the flow of the 
Selector battles themselves.

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.440
Confirmation.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.800
Is Carnival behind it, then?

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:14.080
At first, I thought so.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:17.660
But after talking to Donor, 
I changed my mind.

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:23.410
I just suddenly found myself there.

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:24.800
"There"?

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:26.720
You've been there, too.

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:28.790
The place where you first met your LRIGs.

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:33.040
It's the room of white windows.

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:37.840
The room where Mayu, the girl who 
created the first Selector battles, was.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.150
Surprise...

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:40.300
I see.

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:42.440
I heard a voice there,

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:45.150
and when I answered it, 
I was right next to Kiyoi.

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:48.440
In other words, the "someone" 
who's controlling this is Mayu?

00:09:48.660 --> 00:09:53.690
But Mayu was released in the previous 
Selector battles, and she disappeared.

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:55.740
Confusion.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:59.160
Whose voice was it, then?

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.000
I just heard a voice.

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:03.940
I didn't see anyone.

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:05.370
Hanna-chan?

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:07.020
Acquaintance.

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:08.860
I'm going to talk to someone.

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:10.890
I'll tell you what I learn later.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:18.090
I'm not going to sing.

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:22.600
Hey, Chi-chan.

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:26.880
How'd the discussion go?

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:29.460
Good! We made some progress.

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:30.500
Sorry...

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:35.070
You kept me away because I don't have 
my memories of the Selector battles.

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:36.820
It's fine.

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:38.200
Don't worry about it.

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:42.620
It really is frustrating.

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:46.950
Do you really want your memories back?

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:47.510
Huh?

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:48.660
Uh, I mean...

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:55.670
The memories you want back 
might not be all good ones.

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:58.170
Do you still want them back?

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:01.390
Of course.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:03.360
I see.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:10.450
Question.

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:12.500
Is Kurebayashi-san coming today?

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:14.120
Sorry.

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:17.070
She's taking some time off work.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:19.160
Doubt.

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:20.320
Did something happen?

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:25.190
Her family called and said 
it was for personal reasons.

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:26.280
That's all I know.

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:28.150
Imagination.

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:33.750
If Nanashi-chan were here, she'd say, 
"Something happened, huh?"

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.210
This park...

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:40.740
This is where Yuzuki fought 
a girl named Layla

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:43.510
and was taken away, right?

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:44.180
Yeah.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:46.340
Thanks, Ruuko.

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:49.990
With Yuzuki, Hanayo-san, and Midoriko...

00:11:49.990 --> 00:11:52.020
I couldn't handle it all myself.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.150
Don't get down, Hitoe!

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:56.310
That's right.

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:58.740
Let's get all of them back.

00:11:58.740 --> 00:12:01.860
Wow... You're pretty bold.

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:16.380
Give back Yuzuki!

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:20.550
Yuzuki? Oh, you mean this?

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:22.520
Hitoe... Ruuko...

00:12:22.990 --> 00:12:23.760
I'm sorry.

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:26.350
This happened because I was careless.

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:27.210
Don't worry.

00:12:27.210 --> 00:12:28.720
I'll get back you back.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.180
Battle me.

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:39.960
So you beat Uemura Hitoe, 
and then Kurebayashi Yuzuki?

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:42.760
I didn't do it for you.

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:43.650
I know that.

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:46.990
But now Kominato Ruuko will be forced to act.

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:49.240
Who's that?

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:50.620
Is she strong?

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:51.390
She's strong.

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:52.940
How strong?

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:54.930
Well...

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:59.630
Depending on how things went, 
even I might have trouble with her.

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:02.840
I heard you're strong.

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:04.160
She is!

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:06.820
Ruu and I are super strong!

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:10.910
I see...

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:11.890
Then let's do it.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:14.120
Use Yuzuki as your LRIG.

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:15.090
Huh?

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:17.680
I won't fight under any other conditions.

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:20.420
I'm here to save my friend.

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:23.110
You're strange.

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:26.470
Oh, well.

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:28.910
I guess that could be fun every now and then.

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:31.620
I'll play your little game.

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:34.480
Open!

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:51.150
I'm sorry, Yuzuki.

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:52.640
Just hang in there for a bit!

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:55.090
I'm paying for my own mistake.

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:57.310
But, Tama, I'm sorry.

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:59.730
An LRIG can't hold back even if they want to.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:01.350
Don't worry!

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:02.610
I'm strong!

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:05.860
Stop talking and let's just do this!

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:08.320
Ruuko, Yuzuki...

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:12.330
Tama, grow!

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:15.590
Summon Playground Equipment: Snow Sled.

00:14:15.590 --> 00:14:17.620
Control top and turn end!

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:19.140
Grow.

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:24.720
It's no fun at all if I can't fight.

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:25.880
Summon Dinos.

00:14:26.350 --> 00:14:29.650
Show hand and banish Snow Sled.

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:32.200
Tama, I'm sorry!

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:34.530
Tama!

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:35.310
I'm fine!

00:14:35.840 --> 00:14:37.270
Turn end.

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:38.760
That's right...

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:40.780
This is a Selector battle.

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:42.510
Grow!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.660
Summon SIGNI Sanpoku,

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:46.610
attack phase effect,

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:47.830
activate combo,

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:49.070
put snow tracks into play!

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:55.320
She guarded?

00:14:55.320 --> 00:14:58.720
When she fought me and Yuzuki, 
she was ultra-aggressive

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:00.620
and didn't even use a Servant.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:04.390
What's wrong? An attack 
like that won't hurt me.

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:07.080
Attack me harder!

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:08.420
Grow!

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:11.760
Play Double Crush on Yuzuki and attack!

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:19.650
Tama!

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:20.560
I'm fine!

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:25.860
She's calmly testing Ruuko and Tama-chan.

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:28.380
This isn't like Hitoe said.

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:31.360
She doesn't just want to fight!

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:33.340
Now, show me

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:36.790
the power that he said even 
he might have trouble with...

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:50.640
<i>I need to end this battle fast!</i>

00:15:50.640 --> 00:15:51.900
Tama, please!

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:53.470
ARTS: Queen Boundary!

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:03.520
That's it!

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:05.610
That's the power I wanted to see!

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:07.980
But this is only the beginning, right?

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:09.400
Grow!

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:10.800
Coin bet.

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:13.990
Tama, hang in there!

00:16:15.560 --> 00:16:17.100
Burning!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.040
Tama!

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:29.550
I'm just... fine!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.830
You have more power than that, don't you?

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:36.150
You'll never get to them that way!

00:16:36.150 --> 00:16:38.200
ARTS: Overheat.

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:42.210
She enhanced her defenses?

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:43.940
Is she going to drag this out longer?

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:46.810
I can't break that with a direct attack.

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:48.940
But I will end this.

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:51.280
Yuzuki, this is the end!

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:52.690
Yeah...

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:55.340
That's right! Come on! Bring it!

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:56.490
Coin bet!

00:16:56.860 --> 00:16:58.400
Innocence!

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:07.590
Tama!

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:08.960
Ark Gain!

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:26.730
That's incredible power!

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:28.130
This is what I wanted!

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:29.360
It's incredible!

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:38.850
Yuzuki!

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:40.200
Yuzuki!

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:42.350
Welcome back, Yuzuki!

00:17:42.350 --> 00:17:44.400
I'm sorry I caused trouble for you.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:45.910
Thanks.

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:47.370
Don't be.

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:49.880
Yuzuki, did it hurt?

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.130
Yeah, it really hurt.

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:53.530
I'm sorry!

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:54.580
Just kidding.

00:17:54.580 --> 00:17:56.130
Thanks, Tama.

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:58.800
Not bad.

00:17:59.230 --> 00:18:02.290
Now use Midoriko-san and Hanayo-san.

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:04.020
No.

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:06.890
Battling this way is boring. 
I'm done with that!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:10.290
Next time, your LRIG and I 
are going to fight a battle

00:18:10.290 --> 00:18:14.610
that makes blood and flesh 
and bones all scream!

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:22.100
Wow, really?

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:23.670
Where do we go next?

00:18:23.670 --> 00:18:25.660
Hey, isn't that Aoi Akira?

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:26.560
Who's that?

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:27.820
The amateur model!

00:18:27.820 --> 00:18:29.850
I don't know her.

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:33.650
Akira-chan, are you an amateur model?

00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:36.850
Please don't ignore me!

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:38.890
If I know more about you,

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:41.420
I can give you more accurate fortunes.

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:43.520
My fortune-telling is really good.

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:45.140
Shut up.

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:47.720
I just wanted an LRIG.

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:49.850
I don't want to be your friend.

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:52.490
When's your birthday?

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:54.860
What's your blood type?

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:57.370
Your favorite color?

00:18:58.350 --> 00:18:59.860
Dog person or cat person?

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:01.030
Give it a rest!

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:03.260
If you don't shut up, I'll rip you in half!

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:06.740
Your fortune says you'll 
have trouble with water.

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:13.740
See?

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:17.260
Let's be friends, Akira-chan.

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:18.770
Hell no.

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:22.970
Once I'm done with Kiyoi, 
I'm throwing you in the trash.

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:25.550
You're stopping after one fight?

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:29.160
Let's keep playing with Kiyoi-chan forever!

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:32.060
Then I can be happy!

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:35.570
You're screwed up.

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:38.280
So are you, aren't you, Akira-chan?

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:42.450
I happen to know her weakness.

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:45.220
Yeah? What weakness is that?

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:47.750
Kiyoi,

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:49.250
which do you like?

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:51.870
I don't know about that stuff.

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:54.880
Just tell me which you prefer.

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:58.090
This one, I guess.

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:00.130
Okay, here.

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:02.640
I'll get this one.

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:03.680
We can be twins!

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:05.640
No.

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:07.920
Let's do it!

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:10.040
This stuff's on sale, and it's cheap.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:11.200
No way.

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:13.150
You're no fun.

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:17.570
Eat up. We've got three more places to go.

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:21.320
You wanted me to come here 
just to go shopping with you?

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:22.640
That's right.

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:26.320
You're always so busy with 
your Selector battles

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:28.360
that you never hang out with me.

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:31.500
This is so good!

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:41.490
That was fun.

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:43.310
Well, I'll invite you again sometime.

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:44.300
Amika...

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:49.940
Thanks for always worrying about me.

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:52.160
Of course I do.

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:53.230
We're friends!

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:54.940
Bye!

00:20:58.630 --> 00:21:01.270
Where am I going to wear something like this?

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:18.130
Amika

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:21.090
What? Did you forget something?

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:22.450
Yeah, I did!

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:26.340
I forgot to kick your ass.

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:28.300
Akira!

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:30.330
That's right!

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:32.720
That's my little Piruluk-tan!

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:36.770
If you want to see her, come to the 
address I'm about to give you.

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:40.280
Yes. Yes, I understand.

00:21:40.280 --> 00:21:41.620
<i>Don't do it, Kiyoi!</i>

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:42.530
Amika!

00:21:41.890 --> 00:21:44.140
<i>Shut up, you stupid bitch!</i>

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:56.040
Attachment / Trick and Trap

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:28.070
For your friend.

00:23:28.070 --> 00:23:30.280
I'll take some embarrassing photos and stuff.

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:32.040
Do what I tell you.

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:33.750
I'll make her pay!

00:23:33.750 --> 00:23:35.400
My wish came true!

00:23:35.400 --> 00:23:38.770
I can finally beat the shit out of you!

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:41.060
Bond / Crime and Punishment

00:23:38.770 --> 00:23:41.060
Bond / Crime and Punishment.
